    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">To strengthen Tunisia's ability to implement their Child Labor National Action Plan (NAP), a multi-stakeholder effort involving government, business, and civil society. The project will turn policy and promises into action by facilitating a comprehensive approach to safeguarding every child's right to attend school and avoid exploitative labor.</narrative>
